  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "現代散文專題",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS ON MODERN ESSAYS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以中文現代散文名篇及論述為教材，研究五四新文學運動以來各種主題、類型、寫法，認識這一文類的特質，並聚焦於楊牧（1940-2020）散文之開創與成就，深化鑑賞、批評能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This is a course using modern Chinese prose and essay by master writers as teaching materials to point out to the students the characteristics of this literary genre, and to introduce the different subjects, types, and writing methods of it after the post May 4th 1919 literature movement. Focus will also be placed on Yang Mu’s (1940-2020) pioneering achievement in this field, to help improve the students’ ability to appreciate and make good judgments of the art.",
